  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v0.6.2 - Pack native macOS USB driver (libBusyTagUSBDriver.dylib) as runtime asset for proper DllImport resolution in dotnet tool and self-contained publish scenarios. Add .targets copy for publish output.\n            v0.6.1 - Fix esptool binaries not being copied to output when consumed as a NuGet package.\n            v0.6.0 - Cloud connectivity (WebSocket and cloud client), Wi-Fi scanning, ESP32-S3 firmware recovery, Mac Catalyst USB driver, bootloader detection, 1.5 Mbps serial speed, storage integrity validation, expanded macOS/Linux support, updated dependencies to v9.0.14.\n            v0.5.4 - Minor fixes after retesting on Windows.\n            v0.5.3 - Library updates and improvements. Fixed issue for device finding on newest macOS version.",
